            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>George Washington's Early Life</strong><br>\nGeorge Washington was born on February 22, 1732, in Westmoreland County, Virginia. He grew up on a plantation and pursued a limited education in the colonial culture of the time. As a young man, he worked as a surveyor, which allowed him to acquire land and gain practical experience. His family's status provided him with early entry into Virginia's planting elite and he was appointed to his first military rank in 1753.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The French and Indian War</strong><br>\nWashington's military career began with his involvement in the French and Indian War, a struggle between British and French forces for control of North America. He served as a lieutenant colonel and was involved in a skirmish that led to the war. His experiences in battle taught him valuable lessons in leadership and the difficulties of colonial warfare, which would shape his future military strategies.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Washington's Political Rise</strong><br>\nAfter his military service, Washington entered politics, serving in Virginia's House of Burgesses starting in 1758. He voiced his opposition to British policies and was a strong advocate for colonial rights. As tensions grew between the colonies and Great Britain, Washington's leadership abilities and military experience positioned him as a prominent figure in the growing resistance movement.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
